<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Acon</span>: Optimizing Context Compression for
<br class="ltx_break">Long-horizon LLM Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
