</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span><span id="S4.F6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation studies on thresholds for compression</span> on AppWorld with gpt-4.1. (1) the number of compressions (compression frequency) for each length of task trajectories (task steps). (2) the performance comparison for each threshold setting.</figcaption>
</figure>
