<span id="A2.T4.2.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Create a new Word file called <span id="A2.T4.2.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">random_paragraph.docx</span> and add the content in <span id="A2.T4.2.7.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">random_paragraph.txt</span> to it.</span>
</span></td></tr>
