<td id="A2.T4.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A2.T4.2.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T4.2.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">who wrote the song <em id="A2.T4.2.11.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Oceans Where Feet May Fail</em>?; who plays Eddie the Eagle in the movie?; when was the last time England were in the final of World Cup?; who plays Chelsea’s mom on <em id="A2.T4.2.11.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Young and the Restless</em>?; what is the largest coin in the US?; who sang <em id="A2.T4.2.11.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Even the Bad Times Are Good</em>?; who sings <em id="A2.T4.2.11.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">This Is My Town</em> country song?; which of the Guianas is not an independent country?</span>
</span></td></tr>
