<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>Additional results for additional guideline optimization step and unified compression on <span id="A5.T11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appworld</span> benchmark (test-normal). Each block reports accuracy (task goal completion score), steps, peak input tokens (<math id="A5.T11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{3}</annotation></semantics></math>), and dependency (<math id="A5.T11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{6}</annotation></semantics></math>) for agents. Best results in each column are highlighted in bold. Rows in blue background indicate the results from <span id="A5.T11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6F5FF;">ours</span>.</figcaption>
